title": "Load-in and safety", "children": [{"id": "7ea35ac3-eeca-4c38-b697-7a2301c65d92", "type": "concept", "title": "PPE"}, {"id": "de8bc034-13c4-4745-871b-fce9dde227dc", "type": "concept", "title": "lift plans"}, {"id": "1b48e315-4020-4284-b85a-c6071b69ad87", "type": "concept", "title": "hazard reporting"}], "description": "Students learn basic expectations for moving scenery, equipment, props, costumes, and people safely."}, {"id": "ad78ec1a-7979-492b-aeae-0de9cfe764a2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Cue-to-cue and technical rehearsals", "children": [{"id": "673410bc-5969-4b1d-a51f-d2730f1b7e49", "type": "concept", "title": "cue sequence"}, {"id": "4043c049-e03f-461a-9697-9fb2b327549d", "type": "concept", "title": "hold language"}, {"id": "1356eb42-a070-4335-b7c1-00cf86ce8479", "type": "concept", "title": "headset protocol"}], "description": "The unit explains how cues, transitions, scene shifts, and communication systems are built."}, {"id": "430b5c33-11ae-4d90-b3ca-3c1059afac76", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Documentation during tech", "children": [{"id": "afe5ce55-d89b-49af-b5d9-997133620334", "type": "concept", "title": "prompt book updates"}, {"id": "5a91752a-7a6b-4aef-91a8-ea82f89346c6", "type": "concept", "title": "preset lists"}, {"id": "29c286c5-91bf-47f1-af91-b32952102519", "type": "concept", "title": "tech notes"}], "description": "Students practice updating paperwork quickly and accurately as the show changes."}]}, {"id": "6b833cb3-01ef-423d-afe5-98b828ac2034", "type": "topic", "title": "The Performance Run", "description": "Students learn how consistency, care, and responsiveness sustain a show after opening night.", "children": [{"id": "58702fcf-be7c-429c-a84e-14aa5b5ea772", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Pre-show and show calls", "children": [{"id": "ae13fb44-f9f2-4feb-8970-924e397d867c", "type": "concept", "title": "sign-in"}, {"id": "49d2b25e-60e9-494d-86b2-b6c2efe839cf", "type": "concept", "title": "warm-ups"}, {"id": "b55454b8-953f-4674-a6cc-6