rn the basics of consent-based rehearsal practice for physical, emotional, and intimate material."}]}, {"id": "6e429fd3-295e-4c12-8e12-d2010844ce8f", "type": "topic", "title": "Crew Assignments and Responsibilities", "description": "This unit clarifies how each production role contributes to a safe, organized, and coherent performance.", "children": [{"id": "ce05f7a2-45e5-4a39-b800-8ef870cd436c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Department roles", "children": [{"id": "f49cda79-64a6-44a9-b79b-c25ed06f8658", "type": "concept", "title": "role descriptions"}, {"id": "41bbf955-a4c2-46a0-b96d-f2f7b4a69ea9", "type": "concept", "title": "reporting lines"}, {"id": "a73403bc-3ee8-40ae-8803-a091aeab9ed2", "type": "concept", "title": "handoff points"}], "description": "Students learn the responsibilities of stage management, deck crew, props, wardrobe, electrics, sound, and front of house."}, {"id": "fedd80de-aab3-4a0f-bc96-ff34e2fba1d8", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Paperwork and tracking", "children": [{"id": "9af3477f-b765-4732-aacc-42048ea603fa", "type": "concept", "title": "run sheets"}, {"id": "c7c9e0be-fb86-4723-8d69-a86c43cc67ed", "type": "concept", "title": "prop tracking"}, {"id": "2ec61172-ec88-4d64-85c3-0038efae1df1", "type": "concept", "title": "shift plots"}], "description": "The practicum emphasizes documentation that helps the show run reliably."}, {"id": "bde8916e-4b53-4e12-b9a9-7b176b94e198", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Accountability and readiness", "children": [{"id": "46276768-fc16-4f69-b7ce-fde8077eb2ab", "type": "concept", "title": "task ownership"}, {"id": "d6d79c27-6ccc-4a87-8277-921b65eee8de", "type": "concept", "title": "pre-show checks"}, {"id": "ec7ebfce-b7ab-40e9-9382-77e2c2958b14", "type": "concept", "title": "backup plans"}], "description": "Students connect individual preparation to ensemble trust and production safety."}]}, {"id": "98a1adbd-2388-4c92-ad4c-b71718beaa2b", "type": "topic", "title": "Collaboration with the Production Team", "descri