1ac-c80b-4a5a-987e-81aed1637f7a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Safety during strike", "children": [{"id": "fe2b2803-eec8-4390-a014-95b79cc46085", "type": "concept", "title": "power-down"}, {"id": "a30531bc-764a-4f1f-9afa-df55606022a0", "type": "concept", "title": "ladder use"}, {"id": "59363e51-1195-497e-aafa-6a60e2fab0f6", "type": "concept", "title": "traffic flow"}], "description": "The course emphasizes hazards that appear when fatigue is high and scenery is coming apart."}, {"id": "afc04f13-b08d-46d2-9f2f-1fff68ccecb0", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Restoration and stewardship", "children": [{"id": "20942433-415b-46b5-9830-1667232a217f", "type": "concept", "title": "inventory"}, {"id": "526fdc84-870b-4c23-8fb6-8d20a34db441", "type": "concept", "title": "repairs"}, {"id": "8920d0e3-556a-4434-b938-a910de712f6a", "type": "concept", "title": "venue reset"}], "description": "Students connect strike to care for spaces, equipment, costumes, props, and future productions."}]}, {"id": "d4ee8450-6397-4561-92bf-060cb390abf2", "type": "topic", "title": "Rotating Production Roles", "description": "Students rotate through roles to understand the whole production ecology and develop respect for every area of labor.", "children": [{"id": "2d83f72b-c3e7-4b9d-8056-2db2399b26af", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Role rotation plan", "children": [{"id": "b028e72e-b30e-4f44-b89b-0b6fa574e78e", "type": "concept", "title": "rotation schedule"}, {"id": "ce938fb5-fcfa-475e-a771-e570f6617358", "type": "concept", "title": "training checklists"}, {"id": "3c1529f6-38c1-40fd-a521-bf99711224f0", "type": "concept", "title": "role briefs"}], "description": "Students learn expectations for rotating through performance, crew, management, and support responsibilities."}, {"id": "44db8ae0-b3fc-4545-807a-0edcbcade9b4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Cross-training", "children": [{"id": "23e9ad15-f615-4ffb-a90b-ba481bb4e946", "type": "concept", "title": "shadowing"}, {"id": "992b1d04-4c9c-4f5b-b810-a3c1