utside the room so calls can be productive."}, {"id": "62285d03-497c-4367-80bc-f731cf39f374", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Sustainable practice", "children": [{"id": "ddb42147-3ace-4d26-8b15-5aba612625a6", "type": "concept", "title": "breaks"}, {"id": "8244edf9-9c39-42ba-95e1-801da58e3dd7", "type": "concept", "title": "sleep and recovery"}, {"id": "166f1716-9b27-471a-993a-0f6cc1510456", "type": "concept", "title": "asking for help early"}], "description": "Students discuss fatigue, focus, recovery, and responsible workload management."}]}, {"id": "c2de5874-3810-4873-b78d-8c847073472e", "type": "topic", "title": "Reflective Evaluation", "description": "Reflection turns production experience into durable learning about craft, collaboration, leadership, and future practice.", "children": [{"id": "3cd5d7fd-d8e9-4be7-8e73-76383ffc4533", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Self-assessment", "children": [{"id": "e9ef34d1-dd0f-4adb-a06f-da2a4ee5d2a5", "type": "concept", "title": "evidence-based reflection"}, {"id": "843a0284-3ca1-441b-b5ed-9ddac68e40ad", "type": "concept", "title": "strengths"}, {"id": "e5667237-d30d-4ef6-a476-7f931757e22a", "type": "concept", "title": "growth areas"}], "description": "Students evaluate preparation, collaboration, communication, reliability, and artistic contribution."}, {"id": "62d1feda-2005-47d3-9536-ef42a2712698", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Ensemble assessment", "children": [{"id": "aec6f5e6-05c5-4e09-86dd-91875bd50076", "type": "concept", "title": "postmortem norms"}, {"id": "19526028-8376-411a-897f-a994d111c86e", "type": "concept", "title": "process notes"}, {"id": "607d8555-0429-4171-926b-f4b63b06a877", "type": "concept", "title": "shared learning"}], "description": "The class practices reviewing process without blame so the next production improves."}, {"id": "2c0a4cf8-dc34-43fd-b672-bfd9dfc142f2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Portfolio documentation", "children": [{"id": "88c07f93-5cde-480e-bf5a-f87810d067f3", "type": "concept", "tit